### Mutation testing — Fix 3 (client, orb-widget.js)

Two separate mutations, both restored after, diffed clean against backup:
  1. Removed the `_s._guidedTopicAudioDelivered = true;` statement (+ its
     comment) from the turn-complete handler via exact-match python
     string-replace — exactly 1 of 24 tests failed ("is flipped true at
     the same turn-complete point..."), the other 23 passed unaffected.
  2. Removed the `if (_s._guidedTopicAudioDelivered) { startPayload.guided_topic_resume = true; }`
     block from `_sessionStart()` — exactly 2 of 24 tests failed (the two
     asserting the resume field is sent), the other 22 passed unaffected.

### Mutation testing — Fix 3 (server, guided-topic-narration.ts)

Two separate mutations, both restored after, diffed clean against backup:
  1. Reverted `spokenLesson`'s ternary to unconditionally compute the
     opener/post-narration line (dropping the `inputs.isResume ? '' : ...`
     branch) — exactly 1 of 19 tests failed ("userFacingLine is empty on a
     resume..."), the other 18 passed unaffected.
  2. Reverted the Polly-synthesis guard from `if (!inputs.isResume)` to
     `if (true)` (always synthesize) — exactly 1 of 19 tests failed ("does
     NOT call Polly synthesis on a resume..."), the other 18 passed
     unaffected. (Different single test than mutation 1, confirming the
     two branches are independently covered.)

